                        "entry_id": "51d638c7-1b5d-3755-bb6f-71dbe4745064",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In an ominous manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d21daee-4f97-49ae-b50b-377876d1634b",
                                "sense_id": "7a97a23e-0fdd-3a09-a6de-4cfe42a40e2b",
                                "text": "The cold light of the moon touched every face with unnatural paleness; and the silence was unbroken and portentously profound."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "000d501a-8c46-4c2a-9355-9e251f8b04ac",
                                "sense_id": "7a97a23e-0fdd-3a09-a6de-4cfe42a40e2b",
                                "text": "At that moment a long, scraggy individual in a checked suit poked his head into the bar, looked around portentously, whistled mysteriously to my informant, and jerked his thumb and head in the direction of the door."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ae078f7-226b-45b7-a8ed-325b9697beaf",
                                "sense_id": "7a97a23e-0fdd-3a09-a6de-4cfe42a40e2b",
                                "text": "Shirky ends the story of the lost Sidekick by asking, portentously, “What happens next?”—no doubt imagining future waves of digital protesters."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
